@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Valid and invalid login verification
actor "Test browser / client" as Client
participant "Authentication endpoint" as Auth
database "Controlled user fixture" as User
participant "Session state" as Session
Client -> Auth : Submit test credentials
Auth -> User : Resolve identity and verify password
alt credentials valid
 Auth -> Session : Establish authenticated state
 Auth --> Client : Successful authentication response
 Client -> Auth : Subsequent protected request
 Auth -> Session : Resolve authenticated identity
 Auth --> Client : Expected protected response
else invalid password or unknown account
 Auth --> Client : Controlled rejection
 Client -> Auth : Attempt protected request
 Auth --> Client : Authentication required
end
note over Client,Session : No plaintext password disclosure or false authenticated state
@enduml
